	<p>When moving household goods across states, it is essential to comply with the GST (Goods and Services Tax) regulations, which require the issuance of GST-compliant e-Way Bills for inter-state transport.</p>

	<p>For inter-state transportation, ensure that the packers and movers provide you with GST-compliant e-Way Bills, which are crucial for tracking the movement of goods across states. The e-Way Bills serve as proof of transportation and are essential for compliance with GST regulations.</p></div>
